{"id":"a2444c3100bb7cf8","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-forcing12-chain-condition-cardinal.md","title":"ZFC Forcing12 Chain Condition Cardinal","display":"df-zfc-forcing12-chain-condition-cardinal — ZFC Forcing12 Chain Condition Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-chain-condition-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing12-chain-condition-cardinal"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing12-chain-condition-cardinal — ZFC Forcing12 Chain Condition Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-antichain.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-chain-condition-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing12-chain-condition-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing12-chain-condition-cardinal — ZFC Forcing12 Chain Condition Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b98049bc73009c64\" href=\"?note=b98049bc73009c64\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md\">../batch11/58-df-antichain.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (poset carrier)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span> (order relation)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\)</span> (infinite cardinal)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Antichain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S\\)</span> (antichain predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b98049bc73009c64\" href=\"?note=b98049bc73009c64\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md\">../batch11/58-df-antichain.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChainCondition}\">\\(\\operatorname{ChainCondition}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}\\)</span> 为类缩写，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\operatorname{ChainCondition}(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\to |A|&lt;\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\operatorname{ChainCondition}(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\to |A|&lt;\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The cardinal bound applies to antichains in the declared poset.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md","status":"resolved","id":"b98049bc73009c64","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-antichain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","ta